      "description": "<p>Four countries call situation ‘entirely reversible’ in joint statement as flooding exacerbates humanitarian crisis</p><p>Australia, Canada, the United Kingdom and Italy have urged Israel to allow critical humanitarian aid to enter Gaza, describing the situation on the ground as “dire”.</p><p>The four countries released a joint statement on Monday morning, urging Israel to allow 150,000 tents and other vital supplies being held at the border into Gaza ahead of winter.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/nov/16/australia-uk-canada-italy-urge-israel-critical-aid-gaza-winter-ntwnfb\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
